:: fake-premier {"position": "2102,33", "size": "100,100"}
<div class="passage-content">
Premiers don't have fight straps.
If you have a jersey with a fight strap and a jock tag, it's one of the following:
	- A Practice jersey
	- A protoype jersey (unlikely)
	- A Fake (most likely)
</div>

